sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Extension UI
  participant Page as Untrusted Page
  participant Core as Coordinator
  participant Local as Local Privacy Workers
  participant Gate as Egress Gateway
  participant VLM as Remote VLM
  participant Exec as Validator/Executor
  User->>UI: Activate and state task
  UI->>Core: Create task nonce + consent scope
  Core->>Page: Read nav/document/mutation/viewport
  par Local observation
    Core->>Page: Collect DOM/ARIA-derived graph
  and Visible pixels
    Core->>Core: captureVisibleTab
  end
  Core->>Page: Re-read state
  alt state changed
    Core-->>Core: Cancel stale snapshot and recapture
  else stable
    Core->>Local: Raw handles + sanitized-task work item
    Local->>Local: Normalize, detect, OCR, classify, cover
    Local->>Local: Compile fresh image/graph and verify exact bytes
    alt blocked or remask
      Local-->>UI: Safe status; no network
    else SAFE_TO_SEND
      Local->>Gate: Digest-bound VerifiedEnvelope
      Gate->>VLM: Minimized sanitized request
      VLM-->>Gate: One strict ActionPlan
      Gate->>Exec: Untrusted action
      Exec->>Page: Validate snapshot and live DOM target
      alt high-risk
        Exec->>UI: Confirm exact action digest
        User-->>UI: Confirm / decline
        UI->>Exec: Single-use confirmation
        Exec->>Page: Revalidate target and state
      end
      Exec->>Page: Execute permitted DOM action
      Page-->>Exec: New state / postcondition
      Exec-->>UI: Privacy-safe receipt
    end
  end
